OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FSurvivors and bereaved families of the
OL,7,FSummerland fire disaster say they will
OL,8,Fcontinue to "fight for the truth"
OL,9,Fafter their legal challenge for new
OL,10,Finquests was dismissed by the Isle of
OL,11,FMan's High Court of Justice.
OL,13,FCampaigners have spent years fighting
OL,14,Fto overturn the original inquest
OL,15,Fverdicts of "death by misadventure"
OL,16,Fgiven a year after the disaster in
OL,17,F1974, which they condemned as "flawed
OL,18,Fand deeply inadequate."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
