FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FA total of 50 people lost their lives
OL,7,Fwhen the summer leisure complex in
OL,8,FDouglas was engulfed in flames.
OL,10,FThe island's Attorney General had
OL,11,Fpreviously refused to reopen the case
OL,12,F- which was then upheld by the Isle of
OL,13,FMan's top judge on 30 July, who ruled
OL,14,Fthat the refusal to order fresh
OL,15,Finquests was legally sound.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FFollowing the decision, solicitor
OL,7,FHarry Robinson from Phoenix Law, who
OL,8,Frepresents the families, praised the
OL,9,Fenduring strength and resilience of
OL,10,Fthe bereaved as they process the
OL,11,Fruling.
OL,13,F"The families have come to the Isle of
OL,14,FMan for justice following tragedy," he
OL,15,Fsaid. "Their resilience and courage
OL,16,Fmeans that they are not intending to
OL,17,Fgive up following today's ruling.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,F"They have applied for permission to
OL,7,Fappeal because they deserve answers as
OL,8,Fto the circumstances of 50 of their
OL,9,Floved ones' deaths and it is a
OL,10,Fprivilege to support them in the next
OL,11,Fsteps of their fight."
OL,13,FSpeaking on behalf of those fighting
OL,14,Ffor answers, the families expressed
OL,15,Fdeep disappointment at the judgment,
OL,16,Fand insisted the Isle of Man must face
OL,17,Fup to its past failures - vowing to
OL,18,Fappeal the decision.
OL,26,@sD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
