OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FJackie Hallam, who was caught in the
OL,7,Fblaze at just 13-years-old, lost her
OL,8,Fmum Lorna and best friend Jane,
OL,9,Fbrought the legal challenge and says
OL,10,Fshe intends to fight on.
OL,12,F"We are disappointed by the Deemster's
OL,13,Fjudgment. We strongly believe that the
OL,14,F1974 verdicts of death by misadventure
OL,15,Fwere unjust," she said.
OL,17,F"We believe that the inquests at the
OL,18,Ftime were inadequate. Those who died
OL,19,Fdeserved a thorough and transparent
OL,20,Finvestigation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,F"The public deserve to know that the
OL,7,Fjustice system is prepared to revisit
OL,8,Ffailures where necessary. We are
OL,9,Fasking that the Isle of Man faces the
OL,10,Fpast to properly help right previous
OL,11,Fwrongs.
OL,13,F"If your mother or daughter or any
OL,14,Floved one of yours had been through my
OL,15,Fexperience, you would want answers
OL,16,Ftoo. You would fight for the truth.
OL,17,FThat is why we are appealing this
OL,18,Fruling."
OL,26,@zD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
