OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FHanding down the judgment, First
OL,7,FDeemster Andrew Corlett said his role
OL,8,Fhad been to "examine the lawfulness of
OL,9,Fthe Attorney General's decision not to
OL,10,Forder a fresh inquest".
OL,12,FHe told the court there was "no basis
OL,13,Fupon which he can interfere" with the
OL,14,Fdecision, adding an examination of the
OL,15,Fhistorical and present-day meaning of
OL,16,F'misadventure' was "in law, a proper
OL,17,Fverdict in 1974 and would now also be
OL,18,Fa proper verdict".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785415711
OL,3,CHigh Court rejects bid for new
OL,4,Cinquests into Summerland fire deaths
OL,6,FThe Deemster added the Attorney
OL,7,FGeneral had taken in account "all the
OL,8,Fvarious factors which ought properly
OL,9,Fto be taken into account" when making
OL,10,Fhis decision, and said he had also
OL,11,Fproperly looked at the guidance set
OL,12,Fout following the Hillsborough
OL,13,Finquests.
OL,15,F"There is in the Deemster's judgment
OL,16,Fno legal error revealed by the
OL,17,FAttorney General's decision," he added.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
